SEQUENCE ALIGNMENT
------------------

Input data: 476 taxa with 3 partitions and 3305 total sites (0% missing data)

  ID	Type	Seq	Site	Unique	Infor	Invar	Const	Name
   1	DNA	476	1490	247	186	1213	1213	ssu_flank
   2	DNA	476	901	627	450	387	387	full_its
   3	DNA	476	914	477	360	503	503	lsu_flank

Column meanings:
  Unique: Number of unique site patterns
  Infor:  Number of parsimony-informative sites
  Invar:  Number of invariant sites
  Const:  Number of constant sites (can be subset of invariant sites)

ModelFinder
-----------

Best-fit model according to BIC: GTR+F+I+R3:ssu_flank,GTR+F+I+R4:full_its,GTR+F+I+G4:lsu_flank

